{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q420984","formula":"C₁₀H₉AgN₄O₂S","hill":"C10H9AgN4O2S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S","Ag"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":9.0,"N":4.0,"O":2.0,"S":1.0,"Ag":1.0},"names":{"en":"Silver sulfadiazine","ru":"Эбермин","uk":"Сульфадіазин срібла"},"descriptions":{"en":"Silver sulfadiazine, sold under the brand Silvadene among others, is a topical antibiotic used in partial thickness (second-degree) and full thickness (third-degree) burns to prevent infection. Tentative evidence has found other antibiotics to be more effective, and therefore it is no longer generally recommended for second-degree burns, but is still widely used to protect third-degree burns. Common side effects include itching and pain at the site of use.","ru":"Эбермин (торговое наименование; англ. Hebermin) — лекарственное средство — комбинированный дерматотропный препарат с сульфодиазином серебра в качестве действующего средства, обладающий ранозаживляющим и противомикробным действием. Стимулятор регенерации для местной терапии ожоговых, раневых и язвенных повреждений кожи."},"fame":26,"pubchemCid":441244,"mass":357.14,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CN=C(N=C1)[N-]S(=O)(=O)C2=CC=C(C=C2)N.[Ag+]","inchikey":"UEJSSZHHYBHCEL-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"silver (4-aminophenyl)sulfonyl-pyrimidin-2-ylazanide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"441244","atoms":27,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.819,"y":-1.16,"z":-0.14,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.695,"y":-1.211,"z":0.644,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.834,"y":-0.188,"z":0.778,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.109,"y":0.94,"z":0.102,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.187,"y":1.083,"z":-0.697,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.016,"y":0.029,"z":-0.796,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.307,"y":2.011,"z":0.163,"el":"N"},{"x":0.037,"y":2.068,"z":1.007,"el":"S"},{"x":-0.074,"y":1.777,"z":2.439,"el":"O"},